condition.narrative:
ARCEP Structure Amendments, namely:
40.1.  Amendment of Decree No. 2015-091 to remove, inter alia, MPEN approval/agreement to ARCEP decisions and operations;
40.2.  Appointment of ARCEP board of directors in accordance with Togolese law and mobilization of board;
40.3.  Engagement of independent ARCEP CEO; and
ARCEP board has developed first year performance plan for indepdent ARCEP CEO
